| Odoo Source | `/opt/odoo19/odoo` |
| odoo-bin | `/opt/odoo19/odoo/odoo-bin` |
| Odoo Core Addons | `/opt/odoo19/odoo/odoo/addons` |
| Additional Core Addons | `/opt/odoo19/odoo/addons` |
| Custom Addons | `/opt/odoo19/custom-addons` |
| Python Virtual Environment | `/opt/odoo19/venv` |
| Python الخاص بـ Odoo | `/opt/odoo19/venv/bin/python` |
| pip الخاص بـ Odoo | `/opt/odoo19/venv/bin/pip` |
| ملف إعداد Odoo | `/etc/odoo19.conf` |
| ملف Systemd Service | `/etc/systemd/system/odoo19.service` |
| Odoo Data Directory | `/opt/odoo19/data` |
| Filestore للداتابيز | `/opt/odoo19/data/filestore/amazon_prod` |
| Odoo Log | `/var/log/odoo19/odoo19.log` |
| Installation Log | `/var/log/odoo19-install.log` |
| Nginx Configuration | `/etc/nginx/sites-available/odoo19` |
| Nginx Enabled Link | `/etc/nginx/sites-enabled/odoo19` |
| Nginx Access Log | `/var/log/nginx/odoo19_access.log` |
| Nginx Error Log | `/var/log/nginx/odoo19_error.log` |
| Logrotate Configuration | `/etc/logrotate.d/odoo19` |
| كلمات المرور الحالية | `/root/odoo19-install-secrets.txt` |
| PostgreSQL Data | `/var/lib/postgresql/16/main` |
| قاعدة البيانات | `amazon_prod` |
| Odoo Internal Port | `127.0.0.1:8069` |
| Public Web Port | `80` |

الموديول سيكون هنا:
```
/opt/odoo19/custom-addons/sdlc_amazon_connector
```

