## تثبيت وتحديث الموديولات

**تثبيت sdlc_amazon_connector أول مرة:**
```bash
sudo systemctl stop odoo19
sudo -u odoo19 /opt/odoo19/venv/bin/python \
  /opt/odoo19/odoo/odoo-bin \
  -c /etc/odoo19.conf \
  -d amazon_prod \
  -i sdlc_amazon_connector \
  --without-demo=all \
  --stop-after-init
sudo systemctl start odoo19
```

**تحديث الموديول بعد تعديل الكود:**
```bash
sudo systemctl stop odoo19
sudo -u odoo19 /opt/odoo19/venv/bin/python \
  /opt/odoo19/odoo/odoo-bin \
  -c /etc/odoo19.conf \
  -d amazon_prod \
  -u sdlc_amazon_connector \
  --stop-after-init
sudo systemctl start odoo19
```

**متابعة النتيجة:**
```bash
sudo tail -n 200 /var/log/odoo19/odoo19.log
```

**دخول Odoo Shell:**
```bash
sudo -u odoo19 /opt/odoo19/venv/bin/python \
  /opt/odoo19/odoo/odoo-bin shell \
  -c /etc/odoo19.conf \
  -d amazon_prod \
  --no-http
```

